2026-03-05T13:23:31Z	Cognito user pool should not allow anyone to sign themselves up via an app - (Broadridge)	HIGH	IN_PROGRESS	This rule checks if the Cognito User Pool is configured to allow anyone on the Internet to sign up via application.  																																							
This rule fails if `AdminCreateUserConfig.AllowAdminCreateUserOnly` is set to `false`	 and `LambdaConfig` contains a `null` configuration.  																																										
In case the Cognito User Pool is integrated with a Cognito Identity Pool	 it might allow anyone to generate a new Identity ID for the User Pool and assume the authenticated Cognito role. Depending on the role's permissions	 this may allow any newly registered users high privileges in your AWS account.  																																									
If there is no reasonable reason to allow anyone to sign themselves up via application	 it is recommended to disable this option to ensure that only Administrators are able to add new users to the User Pool.  																																										
In addition	 you may also consider adding a Pre sign-up Lambda function that will be invoked when a user submits their information to sign up	" allowing you to perform custom validation to accept or deny the sign-up request."""	userpool	arn:aws:cognito-idp:us-east-1:437377876052:userpool/us-east-1_Udo9hd1qL	4.37E+11	"84c2a1fc-612d-5b9c-acda-6c03e2228f50, 8bbbf1d9-3245-58e7-8837-40ccbc8b4745, c6f60c1b-3c0f-50a7-b4f5-8def04c0f7e0"	"NPD, NPD-ICS, NPD-ICS-AEM"			402549bc-0484-55a5-a4d8-3280815eb1fd	aem-dev-test	us-east-1		AWS		"{""Id"": ""us-east-1_Udo9hd1qL"", ""Arn"": ""arn:aws:cognito-idp:us-east-1:437377876052:userpool/us-east-1_Udo9hd1qL"", ""Name"": ""aem-dev-test"", ""Domain"": ""aem-dev-test"", ""Status"": """", ""Policies"": {""SignInPolicy"": {""AllowedFirstAuthFactors"": [""PASSWORD""]}, ""PasswordPolicy"": {""MinimumLength"": 8, ""RequireNumbers"": true, ""RequireSymbols"": true, ""RequireLowercase"": true, ""RequireUppercase"": true, ""PasswordHistorySize"": null, ""TemporaryPasswordValidityDays"": 7}}, ""CreationDate"": ""2024-07-11T19:05:45.02Z"", ""CustomDomain"": null, ""LambdaConfig"": {""KMSKeyID"": null, ""PreSignUp"": null, ""CustomMessage"": null, ""UserMigration"": null, ""CustomSMSSender"": null, ""PostConfirmation"": null, ""CustomEmailSender"": null, ""PreAuthentication"": null, ""PostAuthentication"": null, ""PreTokenGeneration"": null, ""CreateAuthChallenge"": null, ""DefineAuthChallenge"": null, ""PreTokenGenerationConfig"": null, ""VerifyAuthChallengeResponse"": null}, ""UserPoolTags"": {}, ""UserPoolTier"": ""LITE"", ""UserPoolAddOns"": null, ""AliasAttributes"": null, ""LastModifiedDate"": ""2024-07-11T19:05:45.02Z"", ""MfaConfiguration"": ""OFF"", ""SchemaAttributes"": [{""Name"": ""profile"", ""Mutable"": true, ""Required"": false, ""AttributeDataType"": ""String"", ""DeveloperOnlyAttribute"": false, ""NumberAttributeConstraints"": null, ""StringAttributeConstraints"": {""MaxLength"": ""2048"", ""MinLength"": ""0""}}, {""Name"": ""addre