2026-02-17T09:39:17Z	Route table has a default route (0.0.0.0/0) to a NAT Gateway - (Broadridge)	HIGH	IN_PROGRESS	"This custom rule identifies private subnets whose associated route table contains a default route (0.0.0.0/0) pointing to a NAT Gateway. In the IP network design, private subnets are expected to send all non-local traffic through a Transit Gateway to ensure centralized routing, inspection, and governance. A default route to a NAT Gateway changes the intended egress path by enabling direct internet-bound outbound connectivity for resources in the private subnet, which can bypass required centralized security controls, logging, and segmentation enforced via the Transit Gateway. This condition may indicate a subnet that is misclassified as private, an incorrect route table association, or an exception that has not been formally approved."	routetable	rtb-00510c48e42cff16e	4.37E+11	"84c2a1fc-612d-5b9c-acda-6c03e2228f50, 8bbbf1d9-3245-58e7-8837-40ccbc8b4745, c6f60c1b-3c0f-50a7-b4f5-8def04c0f7e0"	"NPD, NPD-ICS, NPD-ICS-AEM"			f5a26259-62f1-5ac7-ae6e-cfc44cf73105	int-private-us-east-1b-rtb	us-east-1	Active	AWS		"{""Tags"": [{""Key"": ""ShortName"", ""Value"": ""aem""}, {""Key"": ""FinancialAnalyst"", ""Value"": ""Alyssa.Nunziato@broadridge.com""}, {""Key"": ""cfa:classification"", ""Value"": ""npd""}, {""Key"": ""EstimatedCosts"", ""Value"": ""None""}, {""Key"": ""Name"", ""Value"": ""int-private-us-east-1b-rtb""}, {""Key"": ""ArcherID"", ""Value"": ""2169""}, {""Key"": ""DevelopmentLead"", ""Value"": ""Deepika.Sharma@broadridge.com""}, {""Key"": ""Owner"", ""Value"": ""Deepika.Sharma@broadridge.com""}, {""Key"": ""ApplicationName"", ""Value"": ""Adobe Campaign Classic AEM""}, {""Key"": ""ApprovedDevelopmentBudget"", ""Value"": ""2000""}, {""Key"": ""cfa:application"", ""Value"": ""aem""}, {""Key"": ""SDLCEnv"", ""Value"": ""int""}, {""Key"": ""ECALiason"", ""Value"": ""rakshitha.govindannavar@broadridge.com""}, {""Key"": ""Function"", ""Value"": ""Cloud Platfo