2024-08-06T20:11:50Z	Service account with admin privileges can be assumed by an internal unprivileged VM with initial access vulnerabilities	HIGH	IN_PROGRESS	"This VM is not exposed to the public internet and has a critical/high severity [initial access vulnerability](https://docs.wiz.io/wiz-docs/docs/vulnerability-findings?lng=en#initial-access). It does not have high privileges in the environment, however its service account can assume an admin service account. Admin permissions allow persistence in the environment, or have wild card permissions on the subscription, account, or project level. "																																							
																																											
