2026-04-14T18:40:33Z	Publicly exposed VM with end-of-life software	MEDIUM	IN_PROGRESS	"This VM is exposed to the public internet, and running software in a version that the vendor no longer supports. "																																							
																																											
Publicly exposed resources are more easily accessible for an attacker than internal ones. Moreover	 end-of-life software will usually not be patched for any vulnerabilities affecting them	 as they are no longer supported. Therefore	 an attacker that manages to execute code on the  VM can exploit unpatched vulnerabilities	" or use a network vulnerability on the VM for initial access to your environment. """	autoScalingGroup	arn:aws:autoscaling:us-east-1:835191511791:autoScalingGroup:d652adfe-265e-439b-a175-6b262e5dab99:autoScalingGroupName/br-icsqa-aem-dispatcher-qXu2r7aP-ASG-URq2Bjvfo9S3	8.35E+11	"3b6d0861-5163-5201-9d14-8ded477824b4, 44450ddf-fa7a-5ee3-b6d2-913ad6e748b9, 5aee9520-f985-538c-97ea-cb17ac876e13"	"PRD, PRD-ICS, PRD-ICS-AEM"			wc-id-169	br-icsqa-aem-dispatcher-qXu2r7aP-ASG-URq2Bjvfo9S3	us-east-1	Active	AWS		"{""Group"": {""Tags"": [{""Key"": ""AccessLevel"", ""Value"": ""Normal"", ""ResourceId"": ""br-icsqa-aem-dispatcher-qXu2r7aP-ASG-URq2Bjvfo9S3"", ""ResourceType"": ""auto-scaling-group"", ""PropagateAtLaunch"": true}, {""Key"": ""AlertsNotificationDL"", ""Value"": ""BRAdobeSupport@broadridge.com"", ""ResourceId"": ""br-icsqa-aem-dispatcher-qXu2r7aP-ASG-URq2Bjvfo9S3"", ""ResourceType"": ""auto-scaling-group"", ""PropagateAtLaunch"": true}, {""Key"": ""ChargeCode"", ""Value"": ""ARGUS-5677-444-00698-000-XC AWS ADOBECX"", ""ResourceId"": ""br-icsqa-aem-dispatcher-qXu2r7aP-ASG-URq2Bjvfo9S3"", ""ResourceType"": ""auto-scaling-group"", ""PropagateAtLaunch"": true}, {""Key"": ""DataProfile"", ""Value"": ""Restricted"", ""ResourceId"": ""br-icsqa-aem-dispatcher-qXu2r7aP-ASG-URq2Bjvfo9S3"", ""ResourceType"": ""auto-scaling-group"", ""PropagateAtLaunch"": true}, {""Key"": ""Dept"", ""Value"": ""444"", ""ResourceId"": ""br-icsqa-aem-dispatcher-qXu2r7aP-ASG-URq2Bjvfo9S3"", ""ResourceType"": ""auto-scaling-group"", ""PropagateAtLaunch"": true}, {""Key"": ""ExpirationDate"", ""Value"": ""Oct-30-2019"", ""ResourceId"": ""br-icsqa-aem-dispatcher-qXu2r7aP-ASG-URq2Bjvf