2025-04-23T08:38:18Z	Data resource with sensitive data has excessive access permissions	MEDIUM	OPEN	"This data resource contains sensitive information and has permissions configured to allow excessive access. Users or service principals with access to this resource have significantly more permissions than required for their job functions, violating the principle of least privilege and creating unnecessary privilege escalation risks."																																							
																																											
Excessive access permissions to sensitive data significantly increase the risk of data breaches and insider threats. When users have more privileges than necessary	 the potential impact of account compromise increases substantially. Moreover	 this excessive access pattern violates compliance requirements that mandate implementing least privilege principles for sensitive data access	" potentially resulting in audit findings or compliance violations."""	role	arn:aws:iam::835191511791:role/OrganizationAccountAccessRole	8.35E+11					wc-id-2565	OrganizationAccountAccessRole		Active	AWS		"{""Arn"": ""arn:aws:iam::835191511791:role/OrganizationAccountAccessRole"", ""Path"": ""/"", ""Tags"": null, ""RoleId"": ""AROA4E5KLDLXUPSCJUJ3I"", ""RoleName"": ""OrganizationAccountAccessRole"", ""CreateDate"": ""2021-11-02T09:42:45Z"", ""Description"": null, ""RoleLastUsed"": {""Region"": ""us-east-1"", ""LastUsedDate"": ""2026-04-27T05:26:57Z""}, ""RolePolicyList"": [{""PolicyName"": ""AdministratorAccess"", ""PolicyDocument"": ""{\""Version\"":\""2012-10-17\"",\""Statement\"":[{\""Effect\"":\""Allow\"",\""Action\"":\""*\"",\""Resource\"":\""*\""}]}""}], ""MaxSessionDuration"": 3600, ""InstanceProfileList"": [], ""PermissionsBoundary"": null, ""AttachedManagedPolicies"": [], ""AssumeRolePolicyDocument"": ""{\""Version\"":\""2012-10-17\"",\""Statement\"":[{\""Effect\"":\""Allow\"",\""Principal\"":{\""AWS\"":\""arn:aws:iam::739199888869:root\""},\""Action\"":\""sts:AssumeRole\""}]}""}"	928966ff-454c-4fd7-b655-d9f4d7d3fc6d	39c54278-eaeb-569d-913a-6bed944aceac				### Limit IAM access																				
* Assign each principal the exact permissions that it needs to function correctly.																																											
* Avoid wildcard permissions from the principal policy?ÇÖs side and the resource-based policy?ÇÖs side.																																											
																																											
"### Protect sensitive data	"																																											
* Sensitive information should not be directly accessible from the internet	 or accessible by easily-compromised principals.																																										
* Limit the data access to only those who need it. Minimize the attack surface of users with access to sensitive data to protect from breaches.																																											
* Make sure that the data is encrypted at rest.																																											
