Customer-managed keys provide better control over data-at-rest encryption and decryption and are required in order to meet compliance standards. Customer-managed keys provide flexibility to enable	" disable and rotate the key and make it possible to configure the encryption type and create key policies."""	elasticFileSystem	arn:aws:elasticfilesystem:us-east-1:437377876052:file-system/fs-704c71c4	4.37E+11	"84c2a1fc-612d-5b9c-acda-6c03e2228f50, 8bbbf1d9-3245-58e7-8837-40ccbc8b4745, c6f60c1b-3c0f-50a7-b4f5-8def04c0f7e0"	"NPD, NPD-ICS, NPD-ICS-AEM"			wc-id-595	aem-service-efs-storage	us-east-1	Active	AWS		"{""Name"": ""aem-service-efs-storage"", ""Tags"": [{""Key"": ""Name"", ""Value"": ""aem-service-efs-storage""}, {""Key"": ""aws:elasticfilesystem:default-backup"", ""Value"": ""enabled""}], ""OwnerId"": ""437377876052"", ""KmsKeyId"": ""arn:aws:kms:us-east-1:437377876052:key/16789749-79b2-43ca-b45f-060dbc5e41ed"", ""Encrypted"": true, ""SizeInBytes"": {""Value"": 9607018496, ""Timestamp"": ""2026-04-27T07:08:40Z"", ""ValueInIA"": 9181032448, ""ValueInArchive"": 0, ""ValueInStandard"": 425986048}, ""CreationTime"": ""2021-09-07T17:20:41Z"", ""FileSystemId"": ""fs-704c71c4"", ""CreationToken"": ""quickCreated-d5305002-8285-45c5-ae31-5e2b38853b35"", ""FileSystemArn"": ""arn:aws:elasticfilesystem:us-east-1:437377876052:file-system/fs-704c71c4"", ""LifeCycleState"": ""available"", ""ThroughputMode"": ""bursting"", ""PerformanceMode"": ""generalPurpose"", ""AvailabilityZoneId"": null, ""AvailabilityZoneName"": null, ""FileSystemProtection"": {""ReplicationOverwriteProtection"": ""ENABLED""}, ""NumberOfMountTargets"": 2, ""ProvisionedThroughputInMibps"": null}"	087585e3-86ca-418a-8ef8-3c1f89cbdd96	96c4723a-4cb7-5961-becb-abd388e8ad79		Updated by runbook: <a href='/#/automations/runbook/63191'>Wiz Findings Status Update</a> 																								
